user default off
user cluster_internal_admin on
user app_user on >SuperStrongAppPassword123! ~app-specific-keyspace:* +get +set +del +expire
user monitor_user on >AnotherStrongMonitorPassword123! ~* +ping +info +client|list
user sentinel_admin on >SuperSecureSentinelPassword123! ~* +ping +info +multi +exec +slaveof +acl
user secured_app_user on #2c9a8d02fc17ae77e926d38fe83c3529d6638d1d636379503f0c6400e063445f ~* +@read +@write +ping +info +multi +exec +slaveof +acl